# TIP4P/2005 ice Ih / water slab. Ice molecules 1 through ${nice} are
# pinned while the liquid half is melted at 300 K and cooled to the
# model interface temperature, then the whole slab is equilibrated.
# TIP4P/2005: Abascal and Vega, J. Chem. Phys. 123, 234505 (2005).
# Melting point 252 K. epsilon_O = 0.1852 kcal/mol, sigma_O = 3.1589 A,
# q_H = 0.5564, q_M = -1.1128 placed by the pair style, d_OM = 0.1546 A,
# r_OH = 0.9572 A, angle 104.52 degrees. The step is 2 fs.
# Nose-Hoover temperature damping is 0.2 ps and the z pressure damping
# is 2 ps, the usual rigid-water multiples of a 2 fs step. The lateral
# box is held so the ice lattice spacing stays put.

variable nice index 2048
variable nmelt index 10000
variable ncool index 5000
variable nequil index 10000
variable seed index 2522005
variable iseed index 2522022
variable temp index 252.0

units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p
atom_modify map array

read_data data.tip4p

bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 450.0 0.9572
angle_style harmonic
angle_coeff 1 55.0 104.52
special_bonds lj/coul 0.0 0.0 0.0
# A hydrogen that sits just outside a face is bonded across that face.
# The image flags have to describe that bond before the pair style runs.
reset_atoms image all

pair_style lj/cut/tip4p/long 1 2 1 1 0.1546 10.0
pair_modify mix arithmetic
kspace_style pppm/tip4p 1.0e-4
pair_coeff 1 1 0.1852 3.1589
pair_coeff 2 2 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff 1 2 0.0 1.0

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 2.0
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe press density

group ice molecule 1:${nice}
group mobile subtract all ice
# Shake and the minimiser fight on a fresh interface. The harmonic
# bonds clear the overlaps, then Shake holds the geometry.
fix freeze ice setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0
minimize 1.0e-3 1.0e-4 100 1000
fix shake all shake 0.0001 20 0 b 1 a 1
velocity mobile create 300.0 ${seed} mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
velocity ice set 0.0 0.0 0.0
fix melt mobile nvt temp 300.0 300.0 200.0
run ${nmelt}
unfix melt
fix cool mobile nvt temp ${temp} ${temp} 200.0
run ${ncool}
unfix cool
unfix freeze
velocity ice create ${temp} ${iseed} mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
reset_timestep 0
fix bath all npt temp ${temp} ${temp} 200.0 z 1.0 1.0 2000.0
run ${nequil}
write_restart equil.restart
write_dump all custom equil.lammpstrj id type x y z modify sort id
